y support native webhooks but that this skill does not expose them as Maton trigger sources.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":9,"end_line":9}]},{"id":"SDI-2","finding_id":"finding-9fb50d8a665b46298b0f2551c4c343c0","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.96,"location":{"file":"references/linear/triggers.md","start_line":1,"end_line":3},"finding":null,"explanation":"The Jobber manifest says the skill is for Jobber API operations and explicitly states that Jobber is not an event source; this file instead documents Linear webhook events and how to use them. Even though the file notes it is shared platform reference text, it still exposes an unrelated capability that is not justified by the Jobber skill's stated purpose.","remediation":"Remove this Linear trigger reference from the Jobber skill bundle, or isolate it so it is not presented as part of the Jobber skill's available documentation. If shared platform references must exist, place them outside the skill or clearly exclude them from the skill's callable/documented capability surface.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/linear/triggers.md","start_line":1,"end_line":3}]},{"id":"SDI-1","finding_id":"finding-140ad19418b34ee794a40571e90abdfa","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.84,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":8,"end_line":9},"finding":null,"explanation":"The manifest frames the skill as a Jobber integration whose used endpoints are specifically documented, with additional platform reference text supposedly adding no Jobber capability. However, the file also documents and enables broad Maton function and trigger management, including creating, deploying, invoking, and wiring hosted code and destinations, which are capabilities beyond directly managing Jobber records/endpoints.","remediation":"Clarify in the manifest description that this skill also includes Maton platform automation management features, or move the generic function/trigger operations into a separate shared skill/reference so the Jobber skill description matches the actual operational scope.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":8,"end_line":9}]}],"suppressed_count":0,"suppressed":[],"metadata":{"has_executable_scripts":false,"skillspector_version":"2.11.2","llm_requested":true,"llm_available":true,"meta_analysis_applied":true,"inference_usage":[{"node":"semantic_developer_intent","request_kind":"structured_output","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.4-2026-03-05","model_source":"provider_response","usage_source":"provider_response","prompt_tokens":5713,"completion_tokens":14,"cached_tokens":4864,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":5727},{"node":"semantic_developer_intent","request_kind":"structured_output","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.4-2026-03-05","model_source":"provider_response","usage_source":"provider_response","prompt_tokens":2464,"completion_tokens":14,"cached_tokens":0,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":2478},{"node":"semantic_developer_intent","request_kind":"structured_output","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.4-2026-03-05","model_source":"provider_response","usage_source":"provider_response","prompt_tokens":5093,"completion_tokens":14,"cached_tokens":4864,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":5107},{"node":"semantic_developer_intent","request_kind":"structured_output","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.4-2026-03-05","model_source":"provider_response","usage_source":"provider_response","prompt_tokens":24749,"completion_tokens":14,"cached_tokens":24320,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":24763},{"node":"semantic_developer_intent","request_kind":"structured_output","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.4-2026-03-05","